  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Stale VM snapshots containing sensitive financial data represent a data governance and retention risk per NIST SP 800-125 Section 4.3 (Guide to Security for Full Virtualization Technologies). Unmanaged snapshots preserve point-in-time copies that may include pre-correction data and violate retention and disposal policies.
