UPDATE questions SET
  choices = $EXPL$["Data between cloud and on-premises tiers must traverse public internet without a secure tunnel","The presentation tier''s use of standard web technologies introduces inherent vulnerabilities","The application tier''s programming language choice creates cross-tier compatibility risks","The on-premises relational database cannot integrate with cloud-hosted application tiers"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Per NIST SP 800-144 (Guidelines on Security and Privacy in Public Cloud Computing), Section 4, data in transit between cloud and on-premises environments may traverse the public internet, creating interception risk for sensitive financial data. Encrypted tunnels such as VPN or dedicated interconnects are required.
