-- Q3462: IT Infrastructure and Architecture [medium/L2]
-- Issues: #1, #3
UPDATE questions SET
  choices = $EXPL$["Choosing the cloud provider offering the lowest overall pricing structure","Using only open-source cloud platforms for transparency and auditability","Ensuring the cloud provider''s corporate headquarters is in the same country","Selecting an in-country cloud region with data residency policies preventing cross-border replication"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Per NIST SP 800-144 (Guidelines on Security and Privacy in Public Cloud Computing), data sovereignty compliance requires selecting a cloud region within the country and configuring policies that prevent cross-border replication or backup. The physical location of data determines jurisdictional compliance.
