  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Master data management (MDM) maintains a single authoritative source for critical reference data such as customers, vendors, and chart of accounts, consistent with COBIT 2019 DSS06 (Manage Business Process Controls). MDM ensures data consistency and accuracy across all integrated ERP modules.
